#. <CLT 4>その写真の記憶がないのは、
#. それが、ねつ造された物だからじゃなくて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The reason I don't remember this picture isn't\n"
"necessarily because it's fake...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何か…<CLT><CLT 3>別の理由<CLT><CLT 4>があるのかもしれない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There might be...<CLT><CLT 3>some other reason<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とんでもない理由が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Some...terrible reason...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とんでもなくバカバカしくて…
#. でも、恐ろしい理由…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>An unbelievable but entirely horrifying reason...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

